1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,898
And iron?

2
00:00:00,898 --> 00:00:02,096
Iron has two.

3
00:00:02,096 --> 00:00:07,851
As ferrous iron, valency two, its equivalent weight is twenty eight.

4
00:00:07,851 --> 00:00:12,955
As ferric iron, valency three, it is eighteen point six seven.

5
00:00:12,955 --> 00:00:16,054
Same atom, two different equivalent weights.

